      "text": "[3:03PM] #LagosAbkExp #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from Pleasure inward and outward to Ile epo down to Super enroute Oja oba is good to go.\n\nVehicular movement from Oja oba where traffic light alternation is on to Charity intersection with another traffic light alternation to Charity road to navigates Social club and Abattoir is in good shape.\n\nAbule egba Jubilee bridge inward journey U turn, Ahmadiyya, Ijaiye, Casso, Meiran, Kola, Moshalashi, Alakuko down to Ajegunle via Amje enroute toll gate is good to go.\n\nLikewise, the return journey from Ajegunle to Awori enroute journey to Abule egba underneath Jubilee bridge is smooth and calm.",
